# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example

# Python
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.coverage
**/coverage.xml
**/htmlcov/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
